================================================================================
NOTICE — what this license does and does not cover
================================================================================

The MIT license above covers ONLY the material authored by this project:

  * installer/       the installer, in full
  * tools/           the build scripts
  * docs/            the documentation
  * patches/         the ADDED lines in each patch file — i.e. the mod's own
                     code (roughly 15,000 lines)

It does NOT and CANNOT cover:

  * The game "Machine Party", its code, assets, or data in any form.
  * The unchanged lines of the game's own scripts that appear inside the patch
    files as diff context (roughly 1,800 lines). Those remain the property of
    their copyright holder and are present only in the minimum amount needed
    for the patches to apply reliably.

This project is an UNOFFICIAL third-party modification. It is not affiliated
with, authorized by, sponsored by, or endorsed by the developer or publisher of
Machine Party. No game files are redistributed: you must own a legitimate copy
of the game, and the installer patches only your own local installation.

If you are a rights holder and want this repository taken down, please open an
issue and it will be handled.
